# The names of internal repositories that must not appear in this public repository, each as
# the lowercase hex SHA-256 of the lowercase name (no newline), so the list itself does not name
# them. One digest per line; a line that starts with `#` and an empty line are ignored.
#
# This file is NOT scanned by the hygiene lint (tests/hygiene/main.rs excludes it by path).
#
# To add a name:  printf %s '<lowercase name>' | sha256sum
# and paste the 64 hex digits on a line of their own.
#
# The lint lowercases each text, splits it into tokens at every character outside
# [a-z0-9_-], hashes each token and refuses a token whose digest is listed here.
5798ce3a6a4bc8f6fcf1bad58aec1ebfe9d305f0de7760383a81289099a9714f
